translation:
MEDICAL REMEDIES FOR VARIOUS CONDITIONS
For all the infirm, for ailments of the head,
for throat pain, for relief of roughness,
for aches, for eyelid complaints, for irritations of the eye,
for swelling and pain, for soreness,
for swollen neck, for hip pain and leg ailments,
for bodily weakness and conditions of the chest.

Medical remedies against all troubles of the eyes
of men — for dimness of sight, for inflammation,
for running of the eyes, for conditions that come upon them,
for blood in the eye, for pressing pain, for
swellings, for conditions of the muscles,
for cramps in the limbs, for sores and wounds,
for parasites under the eyelid and all afflictions
of this kind.

Medical remedies for all pains of the ears,
for pain of the jaw, for loss of hearing,
for worms in the ear, for noise in the ear,
for discharge and running, for all ailments and weakness
of this kind.
